{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the ring with Ragdoll Boxing Demo, a sneak peek at the physics-powered boxing game where every hit counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo lets you experience the core mechanics of Ragdoll Boxing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Active ragdoll physics drive every punch, stumble, and knockout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo gameplay against dynamic AI opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision-based combat focused on timing, movement, and positioning</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is single-player only</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer mode, additional characters, arenas, and game modes will be available in the full version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a feel for the unique mechanics and prepare for the full fight coming soon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661720?t=1745447430","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661720?t=1745447430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661720/05428caa65b7e8f0473b331da398648bf02dfec7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745447430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661720/05428caa65b7e8f0473b331da398648bf02dfec7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745447430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into t